# The location sheet names where the second factor is kept. It is the one
# document that must never reach this public repository. The pre-commit hook
# blocks its contents too, in case it is ever renamed.
LOCATION-SHEET-PRIVATE.md
*LOCATION-SHEET*
*location-sheet*

# macOS
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# Key material by file type. These extensions never belong in a public
# repository, and unlike name-based patterns they do not collide with
# legitimately named documentation.
#
# Note: content filtering is handled by .githooks/pre-commit, which is the
# real guard. Do not add broad name patterns such as *seed* or *wallet*
# here: they silently exclude whole directories of legitimate docs.
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.kdbx
*.gpg
*.asc
*.psbt
*.jade
*.wallet
